217
00:13:03,455 --> 00:13:09,417
[SPEAKER_01]: That's one thing I believe that where I was a little successful, I was one of the guys.

218
00:13:09,457 --> 00:13:10,478
[SPEAKER_01]: I didn't change at all.

219
00:13:12,358 --> 00:13:13,979
[SPEAKER_02]: Maybe it was a strength.

220
00:13:14,039 --> 00:13:14,779
[SPEAKER_01]: I think it was.

