224
00:13:24,196 --> 00:13:27,638
[SPEAKER_02]: This is his boat, Mudder's boat.

225
00:13:27,959 --> 00:13:28,939
[SPEAKER_02]: That was a great infield.

226
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:31,622
