237
00:14:18,165 --> 00:14:19,766
[SPEAKER_01]: You can't misjudge a guy for that.

238
00:14:20,486 --> 00:14:21,946
[SPEAKER_02]: Did you have any trouble managing him?

239
00:14:22,206 --> 00:14:24,307
[SPEAKER_01]: Not at all, not at all, no.

240
00:14:26,468 --> 00:14:30,469
