246
00:15:05,021 --> 00:15:06,822
[SPEAKER_01]: He didn't throw hard, I'll say that.

247
00:15:07,603 --> 00:15:13,927
[SPEAKER_01]: But he threw a lot of those screwballs up there, something we were all figuring on hitting against Grove.

248
00:15:15,228 --> 00:15:16,869
[SPEAKER_01]: And when Emke walked out of there,

249
00:15:17,493 --> 00:15:20,514
[SPEAKER_01]: Everybody grabbed a bat and said, oh I want to hit against that guy.

250
00:15:21,074 --> 00:15:22,675
[SPEAKER_01]: Even the bat boy picked up a bat.

251
00:15:24,055 --> 00:15:26,736
[SPEAKER_01]: But he got us.

252
00:15:27,316 --> 00:15:31,498
[SPEAKER_01]: That was the second time around he didn't have it.

253
00:15:32,198 --> 00:15:35,379
[SPEAKER_02]: That was Connie Mack's genius.

254
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:45,683
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, that was the ball game where they just were red hot when they had that 10 run inning.

255
00:15:47,115 --> 00:15:49,076
[SPEAKER_01]: That must have been unbelievable.

256
00:15:49,596 --> 00:15:53,217
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, third time Jimmy Fox went around Third Base.

257
00:15:53,277 --> 00:15:55,457
