258
00:15:55,497 --> 00:16:02,379
[SPEAKER_01]: I got sick and tired of him.

259
00:16:04,580 --> 00:16:07,141
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, what about the trade to Chicago?

260
00:16:07,181 --> 00:16:08,061
[SPEAKER_02]: How did that go?

261
00:16:08,261 --> 00:16:14,503
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, Admiral Wilbur Cooper and myself went over there for Dick Niehaus, George Grantham,

262
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:18,562
[SPEAKER_01]: And Vic Aldridge, a right-hand pitcher.

263
00:16:19,883 --> 00:16:25,827
[SPEAKER_01]: And Moranville and Cooper didn't last long, and I just stayed there until the end of my career.

264
00:16:26,207 --> 00:16:29,769
[SPEAKER_02]: Of course, you left the team to go and win the pennant, didn't you?

265
00:16:29,849 --> 00:16:31,330
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

266
00:16:31,430 --> 00:16:32,551
[SPEAKER_01]: Tony Bush went in there.

267
00:16:33,352 --> 00:16:34,392
