300
00:18:24,021 --> 00:18:27,241
[SPEAKER_01]: I said, well, what do you want to talk to me for?

301
00:18:27,261 --> 00:18:30,202
[SPEAKER_01]: He said, I just want to let you know that you're going down on the next pitch.

302
00:18:31,042 --> 00:18:34,383
[SPEAKER_01]: He's going to dust me off on the next pitch because I got that foul off him.

303
00:18:37,044 --> 00:18:37,364
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah?

304
00:18:37,524 --> 00:18:38,784
[SPEAKER_01]: No, no, no.

305
00:18:38,804 --> 00:18:39,684
[SPEAKER_01]: He was a good guy.

306
00:18:40,104 --> 00:18:42,125
[SPEAKER_01]: He was a great pitcher, Dutch Ruthridge.

307
00:18:43,270 --> 00:18:47,271
[SPEAKER_02]: Did you ever get hit in the head by anybody?

308
00:18:47,631 --> 00:18:54,413
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh yeah, Carl Hummel hit me one day.

309
00:18:54,473 --> 00:18:58,035
[SPEAKER_01]: There was no brushback pitches.

310
00:18:58,075 --> 00:19:01,696
[SPEAKER_01]: When you were dusted off, you were knocked down.

311
00:19:01,836 --> 00:19:05,057
[SPEAKER_01]: There were some pretty mean guys in the league.

312
00:19:05,077 --> 00:19:07,557
[SPEAKER_01]: What were their names?

313
00:19:07,697 --> 00:19:08,518
[SPEAKER_01]: Quite a few of them.

314
00:19:08,578 --> 00:19:09,278
[SPEAKER_01]: Joe Escher,

315
00:19:10,409 --> 00:19:14,012
[SPEAKER_01]: There was one old Joe out of Philadelphia, Philly's.

316
00:19:14,052 --> 00:19:16,093
[SPEAKER_01]: Van Lingle, Mungo, when he got mad.

317
00:19:16,113 --> 00:19:17,714
[SPEAKER_01]: An old Dodger pitcher.

318
00:19:18,255 --> 00:19:19,055
[SPEAKER_01]: Quite a few of them.

319
00:19:19,075 --> 00:19:21,097
[SPEAKER_01]: There was a couple on every pitch.

320
00:19:21,117 --> 00:19:21,898
[SPEAKER_02]: Did Parmer ever hit you?

321
00:19:22,578 --> 00:19:23,559
[SPEAKER_01]: No, no.

322
00:19:23,719 --> 00:19:25,620
[SPEAKER_01]: He was a little bit too wild to throw at you.

323
00:19:26,201 --> 00:19:27,742
[SPEAKER_01]: He hits you unintentionally.

324
00:19:30,504 --> 00:19:34,267
[SPEAKER_01]: You didn't feel too free out there when he was pitching.

325
00:19:34,287 --> 00:19:36,889
[SPEAKER_02]: I talked to him one day, and it's been a couple of hours with him.

326
00:19:38,117 --> 00:19:40,858
[SPEAKER_02]: He hit five batters in the head in his career.

327
00:19:41,358 --> 00:19:45,980
[SPEAKER_02]: And after each time this has happened, they had to take him out of the game.

328
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:49,281
