00:22:03,222 --> 00:22:11,147
[SPEAKER_01]: Of course he pointed out toward the mound and when he was pointing he talked to Guy Bush.

374
00:22:13,209 --> 00:22:24,956
[SPEAKER_01]: Gabby said that Guy Bush was yelling at Ruth and Ruth stepped down the batter's box and he pointed out toward the mound and he says, you'll be out there tomorrow, see what you can do with me.

