00:22:24,976 --> 00:22:26,077
[SPEAKER_02]: Hello Shelly.

376
00:22:26,337 --> 00:22:26,637
[SPEAKER_01]: Hi.

377
00:22:27,158 --> 00:22:28,819
[SPEAKER_01]: He stepped in the batter's box and

378
00:22:30,867 --> 00:22:32,908
[SPEAKER_01]: Root's next pitch, boom, out of the ballpark.

379
00:22:33,689 --> 00:22:34,609
[SPEAKER_01]: So he let it lay.

380
00:22:34,649 --> 00:22:36,630
[SPEAKER_01]: He was a great man, Root was.

381
00:22:37,911 --> 00:22:42,613
[SPEAKER_01]: It was gone and everything, and he just let it lay where it was.

382
00:22:43,654 --> 00:22:45,315
[SPEAKER_02]: How did you work your pitching rotation?

383
00:22:45,735 --> 00:22:46,795
[SPEAKER_02]: Any particular plan?

